{"unit_id":"Leafstory__dsh-context-checkpoint#card-zh","repo":"Leafstory/dsh-context-checkpoint","commit":"00059fd023b856015683ec32a2ad8dde64733a90","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/context-checkpoint 是 DSH 的长会话检查点插件，通过系统提示词段和会话事件钩子连接检查点文件与原生压缩流程。它提供上下文占用查询、压力跨档提醒、检查点内容注入，以及压缩预约和压缩后的任务续接。用户在项目交付点把状态写入 important_view 文件，再调用工具；达到条件后插件在步骤边界安排 DSH 原生压缩，并在新代重新注入检查点。适合需要长时间保持项目状态的 DSH 用户；需在项目目录维护检查点文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:658-730","src/index.js:819-959"]}
{"unit_id":"Leafstory__dsh-context-checkpoint#card-en","repo":"Leafstory/dsh-context-checkpoint","commit":"00059fd023b856015683ec32a2ad8dde64733a90","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@dsh-external/context-checkpoint preserves project notes across long DSH sessions. It adds checkpoint text to the system prompt, reports context usage, and schedules native compaction after a checkpoint is written. After compaction, it reloads the note so work can continue.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:658-730","src/index.js:819-959"]}
