{"unit_id":"Leafstory__dsh-context-checkpoint#feature-1","repo":"Leafstory/dsh-context-checkpoint","commit":"00059fd023b856015683ec32a2ad8dde64733a90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/context-checkpoint 的功能「检查点注入」：将项目目录中的检查点正文作为静态系统提示词段加入上下文；压缩代际变化后重新读取，使新一代能继续参考项目状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:658-673"]}
{"unit_id":"Leafstory__dsh-context-checkpoint#feature-2","repo":"Leafstory/dsh-context-checkpoint","commit":"00059fd023b856015683ec32a2ad8dde64733a90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/context-checkpoint 的功能「上下文状态查询」：调用 context_status 查看可用的真实用量、窗口容量、检查点文件状态和压缩能力探针；计量服务不可用时会说明无法测量。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:729-818"]}
{"unit_id":"Leafstory__dsh-context-checkpoint#feature-3","repo":"Leafstory/dsh-context-checkpoint","commit":"00059fd023b856015683ec32a2ad8dde64733a90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/context-checkpoint 的功能「压力提醒与预约压缩」：跨越占用档位时提醒用户先写检查点；context_compact 在检查点新鲜且满足条件时预约压缩，由步骤边界处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:545-640"]}
{"unit_id":"Leafstory__dsh-context-checkpoint#feature-4","repo":"Leafstory/dsh-context-checkpoint","commit":"00059fd023b856015683ec32a2ad8dde64733a90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/context-checkpoint 的功能「压缩后续接」：压缩完成后重新注入检查点；若压缩发生在回合空闲边界，插件发送续接消息以继续原任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:571-657"]}
{"unit_id":"Leafstory__dsh-context-checkpoint#caveat-1","repo":"Leafstory/dsh-context-checkpoint","commit":"00059fd023b856015683ec32a2ad8dde64733a90","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/context-checkpoint 使用前须知：预约压缩前须先写入或更新检查点；文件缺失或超过新鲜度窗口时，工具不会安排压缩。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:91-110","src/index.js:819-959"]}
